 "text": "Hi, how can I help you? I've been there. Sandwiches are the worst. What do you think of roast turkey? What's your favorite part? Not necessarily. You can use leftover rice. I'm sure it'll be delicious. What about the greens? What kind of greens do you have? Yes, it should be. You can use that. You can also use leftover greens from the roasted turkey. What else do you have in the fridge? Well, you can use a bit of the turkey stock. You can also use some of the turkey's fat. If you have any leftover vegetables, you can use those. What about a good quality mustard? Yes, you can. You can freeze as much as you need to eat and then thaw it later. Do you have any other leftovers? That' what I was thinking. That' a good way to do it.",
